          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Protein powder costs about $59 a tub, $2.11 a serving and $2.26 per 25 g of protein at the median in November 2026. Under $1.50 per 25 g is cheap, $1.50 to $2.25 is normal, and above $3.00 you are paying for a brand, a niche protein or a small bag. Casein, plain pea and big whey tubs are the cheapest; bone broth, superfood blends and meal shakes are the most expensive.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
